	(text "One 100 nF per IOVDD pin (key C_IOV<pin>: placed at that pin).  RP2350 datasheet 6.3.7: VREG_VIN and IOVDD\non one 3.3 V supply (+3V3_RP, the LDO that rises with the console 5V), VREG_AVDD through 33R / 4.7 uF,\n3.3 uH from VREG_LX to DVDD (= VREG_FB).  GPIO33 activity LED; console /WAIT held low by the 2N7002\nfrom power-on until the firmware drives GPIO34 low; debug UART header (DNP): 1 TX GPIO36, 2 RX GPIO37."
